===Noun===
'''Erde''' (''pl'' '''Erden''')

# the planet [[Earth]]
# [[soil]]
#: ''Sie nahm eine Handvoll '''Erde'''.'' (She took a handful of soil.)
# the [[ground]]
#: ''Er fiel auf die '''Erde'''.'' (He fell on the ground.)

